CodexMeter is an independent, unofficial application for local Codex usage
visibility.

macOS release packages include the CodexBar CLI binary so users do not need to
install CodexBar separately on macOS. Windows development builds use Codex CLI
app-server and do not bundle or require CodexBar CLI. The bundled macOS binary
is redistributed under the MIT License. Its complete license text is included at:

  ThirdPartyLicenses/CodexBar-LICENSE.txt

and inside the application bundle at:

  CodexMeter.app/Contents/Resources/ThirdPartyLicenses/

