dependencies. Their complete license and notice files are included in the
application bundle:

  Commander 0.2.2
  https://github.com/steipete/Commander

  SweetCookieKit 0.4.1
  https://github.com/steipete/SweetCookieKit

  Swift Crypto 3.15.1
  https://github.com/apple/swift-crypto

  SwiftLog 1.13.2
  https://github.com/apple/swift-log

  Swift ASN.1 1.7.1
  https://github.com/apple/swift-asn1

The edge docking interaction was informed by SideTerminal's compact
edge-reveal approach. CodexMeter contains an independent AppKit implementation
and does not redistribute SideTerminal source code.

